  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。ピーマンよりも　苦味と　風味が優しいので　使いやすい　食材。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓴맛이 나는 식재료. 피망보다 쓴맛과 풍미가 강하지 않아서 먹기 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有苦味的食材。苦味和風味較青椒溫和，因此容易使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût amer. Une variété moins amère et à la saveur plus légère que les poivrons verts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese bittere Zutat ist vielseitiger in der Verwendung als Grüne Paprika, da Bitterkeit und Aroma bei ihr milder ausfallen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Es ligeramente amargo, pero, comparado con su variante verde, es más suave y más fácil de incluir en ciertas preparaciones.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente amaro più versatile del Peperone verde grazie al gusto meno robusto e a note meno amare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An ingredient with some bitterness—but its bitter notes and overall flavor are pleasantly mild compared to its green cousin.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。ピーマンよりも　苦味と　風味が優しいので　使いやすい　食材。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
